# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
backtest_runner.py - Production backtest runner (STRICT, no demo)

Rules:
- Full year, 1m data. No partial loads.
- No synthetic data, no resampling, no gap fill.
- Avoid lookahead: entry/exit executed on NEXT bar OPEN after a signal/trigger.
- TP/SL triggers detected using current bar High/Low, execution at NEXT bar OPEN.
- Fees applied at ENTRY time and EXIT time (affects equity curve & drawdown).
- One position at a time per pair (LONG only).
"""

